{"version":1,"content":"<p>距離一年一度的墨西哥亡靈節還有數天，當地已充滿濃厚節日氣氛，台灣女星張鈞甯日前親身飛往當地參與大型巡遊，她化上精緻的骷髏彩繪妝容，換上一身紅黑相間的傳統服飾，在街頭開心旋轉起舞，還跟民眾熱情互動，完美融入街頭的節慶氣氛。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T16:20:49.606862+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T16:01:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T16:18:10.925504+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T16:18:10.925504+00:00","content_hash":"38fb12182776b5928ade5eccd1aa5e82ecb86b4832be68f38e7501bc8e690929","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}